msgid ""
"Newly added, additional directories have already been listed. Their use will"
" be explained in the following paragraphs."
msgstr ""
"Nyligt tilføjede, ekstra mapper er allerede blevet oplistet. Deres brug "
"forklares i de følgende afsnit."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/modification_to_extension.rst:45
msgid "Important new files"
msgstr "Vigtige nye filer"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/modification_to_extension.rst:47
msgid ""
"There is a new file your extension needs in order to be recognised by the "
"system. It's called ``composer.json``: it specifies the requirements of your"
" extension as well as some author information. The layout is a simple json "
"array, the keys should really explain enough."
msgstr ""
"Der er en ny fil, din udvidelse har brug for, for at blive genkendt af "
"systemet. Den hedder ``composer.json``: den angiver din udvidelses krav samt"
" nogle forfatteroplysninger. Layoutet er et simpelt json-array, nøglerne "
"burde forklare tingene ret godt i sig selv."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/modification_to_extension.rst:55
msgid "You must not change the ``type`` element."
msgstr "Du må ikke ændre ``type``-elementet."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/modification_to_extension.rst:57
msgid ""
"In the ``require`` section you can also specify other extensions which are "
"required in order to install this one. (*Validation for this is not yet "
"implemented, but should be in 3.3.0*)"
msgstr ""
"I sektionen ``require`` kan du også angive andre udvidelser, der kræves for "
"at installere denne. (*Validering af dette er endnu ikke implementeret, men "
"bør være det i 3.3.0*)"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/modification_to_extension.rst:90
msgid ""
"The second new file is called ``ext.php``. It can be used to extend the "
"functionality while install/uninstalling your extension:"
msgstr ""
"Den anden nye fil hedder ``ext.php``. Den kan bruges til at udvide "
"funktionaliteten, mens din udvidelse installeres/afinstalleres:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/modification_to_extension.rst:110
msgid "Front-facing files, routes and services"
msgstr "Front-facing filer, routes og services"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/modification_to_extension.rst:112
msgid ""
"While in 3.0 you just created a new file in the root directory of phpBB, you"
" must use the new controller system in 3.1 for extensions. Your links will "
"change from something like ``phpBB/newspage.php`` to "
"``phpBB/app.php/newspage``. If the board has enabled url rewriting, your "
"links will look a little nicer like ``phpBB/newspage``."
msgstr ""
"Mens du i 3.0 blot oprettede en ny fil i phpBB's rodmappe, skal du i 3.1 "
"bruge det nye controller-system til udvidelser. Dine links vil ændre sig fra"
" noget som ``phpBB/newspage.php`` til ``phpBB/app.php/newspage``. Hvis "
"forummet har aktiveret URL-omskrivning, vil dine links se lidt pænere ud som"
" ``phpBB/newspage``."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/modification_to_extension.rst:118
msgid ""
"In order to link a specific routing rule to your extension, you need to "
"define the route in your extension's ``config/routing.yml``."
msgstr ""
"For at knytte en specifik routing-regel til din udvidelse skal du definere "
"routen i din udvidelses ``config/routing.yml``."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/modification_to_extension.rst:121
msgid ""
"For an easy start to the Newspage, two rules are enough. The first rule is "
"for the basic page, currently ``newspage.php``. The second one is for the "
"pagination, like ``newspage.php?start=5``. The first rule sets a default "
"page (1), while the second rule requires a second part of the url to be an "
"integer."
msgstr ""
"For en let start på Newspage er to regler nok. Den første regel er til den "
"grundlæggende side, i øjeblikket ``newspage.php``. Den anden er til "
"pagineringen, som ``newspage.php?start=5``. Den første regel sætter en "
"standardside (1), mens den anden regel kræver, at en anden del af URL'en er "
"et heltal."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/modification_to_extension.rst:139
msgid ""
"The string we define for ``_controller`` defines a service "
"(``nickvergessen.newspage.controller``) and a method (``base``) of the class"
" which is then called. Services are defined in your extensions "
"``config/services.yml``. Services are instances of classes. Services are "
"used, so there is only one instance of the class which is used all the time."
" You can also define the arguments for the constructor of your class. The "
"example definition of the Newspage controller service would be something "
"similar to:"
msgstr ""
"Strengen, vi definerer for ``_controller``, definerer en service "
"(``nickvergessen.newspage.controller``) og en metode (``base``) på klassen, "
"som derefter kaldes. Services defineres i din udvidelses "
"``config/services.yml``. Services er instanser af klasser. Services bruges, "
"så der kun findes én instans af klassen, som bruges hele tiden. Du kan også "
"definere argumenterne til din klasses konstruktør. Eksempeldefinitionen af "
"Newspage-controllerens service ville være noget i stil med:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/modification_to_extension.rst:165
msgid ""
"Any service that is previously defined in your file, or in the file of the "
"phpBB core ``phpBB/config/services.yml``, can also be used as an argument, "
"as well as some predefined strings (like ``core.root_path`` here)."
msgstr ""
"Enhver service, der tidligere er defineret i din fil, eller i phpBB-kernens "
"fil ``phpBB/config/services.yml``, kan også bruges som et argument, ligesom "
"nogle foruddefinerede strenge (som f.eks. ``core.root_path`` her)."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/modification_to_extension.rst:171
msgid ""
"The classes from ``phpBB/ext/`` are automatically loaded by their namespace "
"and class names, whereby backslash ( ``\\`` ) represent directories. In this"
" case the class ``nickvergessen\\newspage\\controller\\main`` would be "
"located in ``phpBB/ext/nickvergessen/newspage/controller/main.php``"
msgstr ""
"Klasserne fra ``phpBB/ext/`` autoloades automatisk ud fra deres namespace- "
"og klassenavne, hvor bagudvendt skråstreg ( ``\\`` ) repræsenterer mapper. I"
" dette tilfælde ville klassen ``nickvergessen\\newspage\\controller\\main`` "
"være placeret i ``phpBB/ext/nickvergessen/newspage/controller/main.php``"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/modification_to_extension.rst:176
msgid ""
"For more explanations about `Routing "
"<https://area51.phpbb.com/docs/dev/master/extensions/tutorial_controllers.html#routing>`_"
" and `Services "
"<https://area51.phpbb.com/docs/dev/master/extensions/tutorial_controllers.html#dependencies>`_"
" see our documentation."
msgstr ""
"For flere forklaringer om `Routing "
"<https://area51.phpbb.com/docs/dev/master/extensions/tutorial_controllers.html#routing>`_"
" og `Services "
"<https://area51.phpbb.com/docs/dev/master/extensions/tutorial_controllers.html#dependencies>`_,"
" se vores dokumentation."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/modification_to_extension.rst:180
msgid ""
"In this example my **controller/main.php** would look like the following:"
msgstr "I dette eksempel ville min **controller/main.php** se sådan ud:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/modification_to_extension.rst:250
msgid ""
"The order of arguments in services.yml should match the order of arguments "
"passed to the class constructor ``public function __construct()``. "
"Otherwise, an error will be thrown and the board will be broken if you try "
"to enable the extension."
msgstr ""
"Rækkefølgen af argumenter i services.yml bør matche rækkefølgen af "
"argumenter, der sendes til klassens konstruktør ``public function "
"__construct()``. Ellers vil der blive kastet en fejl, og forummet vil gå i "
"stykker, hvis du forsøger at aktivere udvidelsen."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/modification_to_extension.rst:255
msgid ""
"You can also have multiple different methods in one controller as well as "
"having multiple controllers, in order to organise your code a bit better."
msgstr ""
"Du kan også have flere forskellige metoder i én controller samt have flere "
"controllere for at organisere din kode lidt bedre."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/modification_to_extension.rst:259
msgid "ACP Modules"
msgstr "ACP-moduler"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/modification_to_extension.rst:261
msgid "This section also applies to MCP and UCP modules."
msgstr "Dette afsnit gælder også for MCP- og UCP-moduler."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/modification_to_extension.rst:263
msgid ""
"As mentioned before these files are also moved into your extensions "
"directory. The info-file, currently located in "
"``phpBB/includes/acp/info/acp_newspage.php``, is going to be "
"``ext/nickvergessen/newspage/acp/main_info.php`` and the module itself is "
"moved from ``phpBB/includes/acp/acp_newspage.php`` to "
"``ext/nickvergessen/newspage/acp/main_module.php``. In order to be able to "
"automatically load the files by their class names we need to make some "
"adjustments to the classes themselves."
msgstr ""
"Som nævnt tidligere flyttes disse filer også ind i din udvidelses mappe. "
"Info-filen, i øjeblikket placeret i "
"``phpBB/includes/acp/info/acp_newspage.php``, bliver til "
"``ext/nickvergessen/newspage/acp/main_info.php``, og selve modulet flyttes "
"fra ``phpBB/includes/acp/acp_newspage.php`` til "
"``ext/nickvergessen/newspage/acp/main_module.php``. For at kunne autoloade "
"filerne ud fra deres klassenavne skal vi foretage nogle justeringer af selve"
" klasserne."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/modification_to_extension.rst:272
msgid ""
"As for the ``main_info.php`` we need to adjust the class name from "
"``acp_newspage_info`` to ``main_info`` and also change the value of "
"``'filename'`` in the returned array."
msgstr ""
"For ``main_info.php`` skal vi justere klassenavnet fra ``acp_newspage_info``"
" til ``main_info`` og også ændre værdien af ``'filename'`` i det returnerede"
" array."

